  "observations": [
    "Native moving sprite records contain sheet and motion pointers, with an eight-byte stride.",
    "FE7 reference location is 0x6D574; FE8 documented alternatives are 0x79584, 0x79598, 0xBAC2C and 0xBAC40.",
    "The native MU code indexes the table with class ID minus one; altered engine indexing remains unverified.",
    "AP is relative-offset data with OAM, source tile indices and animation commands. Animation count has no explicit header field.",
    "255 slots is an observation budget, not an approval or capacity.",
    "The FEBuilder 32-pixel sheet display is an editor convention, not verified runtime frame composition."
  ],
  "local_roms_reviewed_here": false
}
